      "writtenOn": "2025-12-10T12:17:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, I see nothing that can prevent that, the only safe way I can see now it to somehow sync with `__pkvm_prot_finalize`.\n\nAlthough, if that happens that means that we just end up with an extra read_lock() call, which is not a problem as we never write after de-privilige.\n\nAnyway, I will drop that for now and rely on the lock, and this can be improved later.",
